1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,350
人生广场，学中文。
Life Plaza — learn Chinese.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:10,390
学中文最难的，不是记住一个词，而是找到一个想开口的理由。
The hardest part of learning Chinese isn't remembering words — it's finding a reason to speak.

3
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:17,670
在人生广场，学习者走进别人的人生，用中文和那里的人聊天。
In Life Plaza, learners walk into other people's lives and chat in Chinese with the people there.

4
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:27,260
进门先选水平。难度由 HSK 3.0 大纲控制，每个人物都照你的等级说话。
First, choose your level. Difficulty follows the HSK 3.0 syllabus — every character speaks at your level.

5
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:36,060
门口的引路人，当过二十年深夜电台主持人。她会问你：为什么学中文？喜欢什么？
At the gate, a former late-night radio host asks: why are you learning Chinese? What do you love?

6
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:40,460
你说喜欢画画，她就送你去梵高的屋子。
Say you love painting, and she sends you to Van Gogh's room.

7
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:50,940
梵高说：请你把窗户打开。你推开窗，他会说：你把窗户打开了。听懂了，就去做。
Van Gogh says: please open the window. You open it, and he says: you opened the window. Understand it — then do it.

8
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:59,330
他说的每一句话，都配着拼音和英文；超出你水平的新词，会用橙色标出来。
Every line comes with pinyin and English; words above your level are marked in orange.

9
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:09,160
点一下生词，就能看到它的等级、例句和发音，还有一条词汇链，告诉你下一步可以学什么。
Tap a new word to see its level, an example and how it sounds — plus a word chain of what to learn next.

10
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:19,080
他会循环提问：你喜欢黄色还是红色？一次只教一个新词，用的都是屋子里看得见的东西。
He asks circling questions — do you like yellow or red? One new word at a time, using things you can see in the room.

11
00:01:19,530 --> 00:01:27,950
问他：把门打开和门打开了，有什么不一样？他不讲语法术语，只用一个例子回答你。
Ask him how 把门打开 differs from 门打开了 — no grammar terms, just one example.

12
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:35,380
你写错了，系统只给一到两条建议，带着拼音，让你自己再写一遍。
Make a mistake, and you get one or two suggestions with pinyin — then you write it again yourself.

13
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:40,340
喜欢电影和拍照的人，可以去梅里爱的片场。
If you love film and photography, visit Méliès's studio.

14
00:01:40,790 --> 00:01:48,250
对中医感兴趣，就去找李时珍：用手机闪光灯测心跳，他给你号脉、开方子。
Curious about Chinese medicine? Li Shizhen reads your pulse — measured with your phone's flash — and writes you a prescription.

15
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:52,730
小朋友可以去五行山，把孙悟空救出来。
Children can climb the Five Elements Mountain and set the Monkey King free.

16
00:01:53,180 --> 00:02:00,570
每个来过的人，都会留下一段自己的日子，变成下一个人可以玩的小游戏。
Everyone who visits leaves a piece of their own life behind — a small game for the next person.

17
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:08,570
别的产品，剧本写在你来之前；人生广场的剧本，写在你开口之后。
Other products write the script before you arrive. Life Plaza writes it after you speak.

18
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:12,070
人生广场，学中文。
Life Plaza · Learn Chinese

